## Error Types Supported

- Linker errors (undefined reference, multiple definition)
- Compiler errors (undeclared identifier, no matching function, not a member of)
- Include errors (missing headers, broken include paths)
- Template errors (implicit instantiation, undefined specialization)
- Segfault / stack traces (GDB and LLVM format)
- AddressSanitizer errors (heap overflow, use-after-free, stack overflow)
- Build system errors (CMake find_package failures, Make rule errors)
- Runtime exceptions (std::bad_alloc, std::out_of_range, terminate)

