## Code Indexing Pipeline

```
C++ Repository
      │
      ▼
Tree-sitter parser (function-level chunks)
+ file-level fallback chunks for zero-function files
      │
      ▼
GraphCodeBERT embeddings (768-dim, batched, GPU)
      │
      ├──→ ChromaDB (persistent vector store)
      │    metadata: file_path, function_name, start_line
      │
      └──→ BM25Okapi index (rank_bm25)
           tokenizer: splits CamelCase, snake_case, operators
```

